WEBVTT

00:00:00.250 --> 00:00:20.250
Vidiyoyi ikusonyeza matenda osiyanasiyana a mtsempha wa kuona, kuyambira ndi kuwonongeka kwake kotheratu.

00:01:10.243 --> 00:01:30.243
Zithunzi zapafupi zikusonyeza disiki ya mtsempha wa kuona ndi mitsempha ya magazi yoizungulira.

00:02:20.487 --> 00:02:40.487
Chithunzi chikusintha pamene kuwala koyezera kukusuntha.
